# CODEOWNERS — soucean-game
#
# Every path listed here needs a review from its owner before a pull request can
# merge. The second block covers the security-sensitive paths of AGENTS.md §4:
# a change to any of them needs Board review in addition to `qa`, and its pull
# request must say `Security-sensitive: yes` and list the paths it touches.
#
# Most of these paths do not exist yet. They are listed now so the rule is in
# force before the first line of code lands. Keep this file and AGENTS.md §4 in
# step — they are two views of one list.
#
# The last matching pattern wins, so order matters: general first, sensitive last.

